# Axial coordination regulation of MOF-based single-atom Ni catalysts by halogen atoms for enhanced CO2 electroreduction

Axial  coordination  regulation  of  MOF-based  single-atom  Ni catalysts by halogen atoms for enhanced $\cdot$ electroreduction
